                <pb facs="0194" n="150" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v05p1/pg150"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The list of participants at this meeting is identical to the list for the third
                    meeting, February 22 (see <ref target="#pg136">page 136</ref>). There are two
                    official NATO records of this meeting: a 5-page summary record, document C9–R/4,
                    which includes the full list of participants, and the 36-page verbatim record,
                    document C9–VR/4. (Conference files, lot 59 D 95, CF 105) There is no United
                    States Delegation record of this meeting other than the telegraphic report
                    printed <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
